Ek gaon mein ek kisan ne apne khet mein aam ka ped lagaya. Wah ped dheere dheere bada hua aur meetha phal dene laga. Ek din shaitaan bandar aaya, aam toda aur chura kar le gaya. Kisan dukhi hua, par samjha ki prakriti mein sab saanjha hota hai aur gaon ke bachche haste rahe, kahani se seekh mili ki lalach chhodkar mehnat aur daya se jeevan sundar banta hai hamesha.
